      "title": "Why is this lesson important?",
      "body": "<ul><li>Ebola is one of the most dangerous viruses in the world.</li><li>The reading question types you practise today appear in your exam.</li></ul>",
      "notes": "Frame the lesson value: the Ebola threat is a real, current news topic; the question types are exam formats."
    },
    {
      "layout": "raw",
      "id": "lead-in",
      "step": 1,
      "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
      "body": "<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;height:100%\"><p style=\"font-size:47px;font-weight:700;color:#fff;margin-bottom:12px\">What do we know about Ebola?</p><table style=\"width:92%;border-collapse:collapse\"><tr><td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><p style=\"font-size:38px;margin:10px 0\">What is Ebola?</p><p style=\"font-size:38px;margin:10px 0\">How deadly is it?</p><p style=\"font-size:38px;margin:10px 0\">What are the workers doing?</p><p style=\"color:#ffdd00;font-size:38px;font-weight:700;margin-top:28px\">Opinion &mdash; Reason &mdash; Evidence</p></td><td style=\"width:50%;text-align:center;vertical-align:middle\"><img src=\"assets/ebola_death.jpg\" style=\"max-width:96%;max-height:470px;border-radius:10px;border:2px solid #555\"></td></tr></table></div>",
      "notes": "Show the death image first: safe-burial workers with a coffin. Ask: What is happening? What is Ebola? How deadly is it? Open-class discussion, accept all answers. The yellow O-R-E label anchors the final discussion."
    },
